/-!
# Realization of the Section 15.4 factor actions

The coordinate construction turns internal module factors and their genuine
permutation action into the quotient witness used by `TwoFactors.Center`.
It also identifies the fixed summand and proves the single-factor index.

Source realization of the fixed-line and permutation inputs, construction
of the mixed local Sylow configuration, and its common pre-branch conclusions
are still required. This module does not assert source 15.4.14 or 15.4.18.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, combined
1 March 2004 manuscript, printed pp.1160–1163.
-/
